# Pixel Run : วิ่งสไตล์มาริโอ้ กดสั้น=กระโดดเตี้ย กดค้าง=กระโดดสูง เหยียบศัตรู/เก็บเหรียญ ข้ามท่อและหลุม
title Pixel Run
fps 30
init
p = 48
c = 1
m[40] = 30
m[41] = 95
i = 0
while i < 4
  m[i] = -50
  i += 1
end
frame
cls
s = 2 + score / 20
if s > 4
  s = 4
end
d += s
fill 0, 56, 128, 8
col 0
line 0, 60, 127, 60
k = 0 - d % 16
while k < 128
  line k, 56, k, 59
  line k + 8, 60, k + 8, 63
  k += 16
end
col 1
if tick % 3 == 0
  m[40] -= 1
  m[41] -= 1
end
if m[40] < -12
  m[40] = 128 + rnd(30)
end
if m[41] < -12
  m[41] = 128 + rnd(30)
end
line m[40], 12, m[40] + 10, 12
line m[40] + 3, 10, m[40] + 8, 10
line m[41], 20, m[41] + 10, 20
line m[41] + 3, 18, m[41] + 8, 18
if btn
  j = 5
end
if j > 0
  j -= 1
  if c == 1
    v = -6
    c = 0
    j = 0
  end
end
h = 56
i = 0
while i < 4
  m[i] -= s
  if m[i + 4] == 1 && m[i + 8] > 0
    m[i] -= 1
  end
  if m[i] < -30
    q = m[(i + 3) % 4]
    if q < 100
      q = 100
    end
    m[i] = q + 80 + rnd(40)
    k = rnd(10)
    m[i + 4] = 0
    m[i + 8] = 12 + rnd(3) * 5
    if k > 3
      m[i + 4] = 1
      m[i + 8] = 1
    end
    if k > 6
      m[i + 4] = 2
      m[i + 8] = 22 + rnd(2) * 6
    end
    m[i + 12] = rnd(2)
    score += 1
  end
  o = m[i]
  q = m[i + 4]
  w = m[i + 8]
  if q == 0
    k = 56 - w
    fill o, k, 12, w
    fill o - 1, k, 14, 4
    col 0
    line o + 3, k + 5, o + 3, 55
    col 1
    if o < 28 && o + 12 > 20
      if p + 8 <= k + 4
        if h > k
          h = k
        end
      else
        over
      end
    end
  end
  if q == 1 && w > 0
    spr o, 48, "3C7EDBFF7E3C66C3"
    if o < 28 && o + 8 > 20 && p + 8 > 48
      if v > 0 && p + 8 <= 54
        m[i + 8] = 0
        v = -5
        score += 3
      else
        over
      end
    end
  end
  if q == 2
    col 0
    fill o, 56, w, 8
    col 1
    if o < 24 && o + w > 24
      h = 99
    end
  end
  if m[i + 12] == 1
    disc o + 4, 22, 3
    if o < 27 && o + 8 > 20 && p < 25 && p + 8 > 19
      m[i + 12] = 0
      score += 2
    end
  end
  i += 1
end
if v >= 0 || held == 0 || tick % 2 == 0 || v >= -1
  v += 1
end
p += v
if v >= 0 && p + 8 >= h
  p = h - 8
  v = 0
  c = 1
else
  c = 0
end
if h == 99 && p > 50
  over
end
if c == 0
  spr 20, p, "3C7F35BE7FDF6663"
else
  if tick % 8 < 4
    spr 20, p, "3C7F353E7EDB3663"
  else
    spr 20, p, "3C7F353E7E7E3C3C"
  end
end
num 0, 0, score
